    SV --> SP : manager outcome
    SV --> SD : manager outcome
    SV --> UN : manager outcome
    SP --> SD : dealer records delivery
    SP --> CL : dealer records the deal lost
    SD --> SD : anniversary YES - still owns it
    SD --> CN : anniversary NO - no longer owns it
    CL --> [*]
    CN --> [*]
